# liquifai: shell-completion behaviour; none is needed to run an app (docs/shell-completion.md)

# LIQUIFAI_COMPLETION_LIST=grouped   grouped | plain — the second TAB's option list (docs/shell-completion.md)
# LIQUIFAI_COMPLETION_COLOR=auto   auto | always | never — the grouped listing in colour; auto: unless NO_COLOR is set or the terminal is dumb (docs/shell-completion.md)
